## Interface: 120000
## Title: Today in WoW (Companion Data)
## Notes: App-managed content + sync state for Today in WoW. Installed and kept current by the Today in WoW desktop app; safe to delete (the base addon falls back to its shipped floor).
## Author: Today in WoW
## Version: 1.0.0
## X-Category: Data

# This addon ships NO SavedVariables. Its single data file is OWNED and rewritten by the
# Today in WoW desktop app on each content/sync push (see data\companion_db.lua). The base
# TodayInWoW addon only ever READS _G.TiWCompanionDB, and does so at PLAYER_LOGIN — so the
# inter-addon load order is irrelevant (no ## Dependencies needed). An absent companion just
# means the base addon runs off its shipped floor.
data\companion_db.lua
